{"id": "html_000028", "instruction": "Build a production-quality, accessible forms component in amber_editorial style.", "context": {"framework": "html-css-tailwind", "requirements": ["html", "forms", "production-quality"], "category": "forms"}, "input": "", "output": "<section id=\"contact\" class=\"py-16 bg-stone-950 text-zinc-100\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-xl mx-auto px-6\">\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-8\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xs uppercase font-mono tracking-widest text-amber-400 mb-2\">Initiate Dispatch</h2>\n      <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-white\">Connect with Autonomous Engineering</h3>\n    </div>\n    <form class=\"space-y-4 bg-stone-900/60 border border-stone-800 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl\">\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"name-33\" class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-400 mb-1\">Your Name</label>\n        <input id=\"name-33\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Alex Vance\" required class=\"w-full p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 text-white text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\" />\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"email-33\" class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-400 mb-1\">Work Email</label>\n        <input id=\"email-33\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"alex@ornament.ai\" required class=\"w-full p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 text-white text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\" />\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"message-33\" class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-400 mb-1\">Engineering Specifications</label>\n        <textarea id=\"message-33\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Describe requirements, target framework, and test assertions...\" required class=\"w-full p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 text-white text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-md transition\">Dispatch Autonomous Agents</button>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</section>", "metadata": {"category": "forms", "difficulty": "advanced", "quality": 0.785}}
