dow-lg\">View Selected Projects</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section id=\"work\" class=\"space-y-8\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white border-b border-zinc-800 pb-3\">Selected Projects</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n      <article class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900/80 border border-zinc-800 hover:border-zinc-700 transition\">\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-zinc-200\">01 / AUTONOMOUS WEB</span>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mt-1 mb-2\">Orn\u00e0ment Agent Engine</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">Full lifecycle AI website engineer adhering strictly to minimal change policy and Playwright test validation.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900/80 border border-zinc-800 hover:border-zinc-700 transition\">\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-zinc-200\">02 / EDGE INFERENCE</span>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mt-1 mb-2\">Quantized Coder Cluster</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">Local-first 4-bit GGUF model execution pipeline operating within 6GB VRAM hardware bounds.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"border-t border-zinc-800/80 py-8 bg-zinc-950 text-center text-xs text-zinc-500\">\n  <p>&copy; 2026 Aria Sterling. All rights reserved.</p>\n</footer>", "metadata": {"category": "portfolios", "difficulty": "advanced", "quality": 0.95}}
{"id": "html_000055", "instruction": "Build a production-quality, accessible cards component in neon_emerald style.", "context": {"framework": "html-css-tailwind", "requirements": ["html", "cards", "production-quality"], "category": "cards"}, "input": "", "output": "<section class=\"py-16 bg-[#06110d] text-zinc-100\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\">\n    <div class=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xs uppercase font-mono tracking-widest text-emerald-400 mb-2\">Engineered Modules</h2>\n      <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-white\">Core Architectural Building Blocks</h3>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n      <article class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-950/20 border border-emerald-900/50 hover:border-zinc-700 transition flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-4\">01</div>\n          <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">Minimal Change Engine</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">Isolates root cause anomalies and applies surgical 1-file diffs while strictly preserving working production logic.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-zinc-500\">\n          <span>Module v1.73</span>\n          <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">Verified [OK]</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-950/20 border border-emerald-900/50 hover:border-zinc-700 transition flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-4\">02</div>\n          <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">Multi-Level Playwright Tests</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">Levels 1 through 7 static compilation, build validation, browser DOM verification, and full WCAG accessibility audits.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-zinc-500\">\n          <span>Suite 7-Tier</span>\n          <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">100% Pass</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-950/20 border border-emerald-900/50 hover:border-zinc-700 transition flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-4\">03</div>\n          <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">Hardware-Gated Concurrency</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">Monitors GPU VRAM and system memory in real time to throttle subagent concurrency and prevent thrashing.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-zinc-500\">\n          <span>VRAM Guard</span>\n          <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">Safe 6GB</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>", "metadata": {"category": "cards", "difficulty": "medium", "quality": 0.835}}
{"id": "html_000076", "instruction": "Build a production-quality, accessible forms component in amber_editorial style.", "context": {"framework": "html-css-tailwind", "requirements": ["html", "forms", "production-quality"], "category": "forms"}, "input": "", "output": "<section id=\"contact\" class=\"py-16 bg-stone-950 text-zinc-100\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-xl mx-auto px-6\">\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-8\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xs uppercase font-mono tracking-widest text-amber-400 mb-2\">Initiate Dispatch</h2>\n      <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-white\">Connect with Autonomous Engineering</h3>\n    </div>\n    <form class=\"space-y-4 bg-stone-900/60 border border-stone-800 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl\">\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"name-105\" class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-400 mb-1\">Your Name</label>\n        <input id=\"name-105\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Alex Vance\" required class=\"w-full p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 text-white text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\" />\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"email-105\" class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-400 mb-1\">Work Email</label>\n        <input id=\"email-105\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"alex@ornament.ai\" required class=\"w-full p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 text-white text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\" />\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"message-105\" class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-400 mb-1\">Engineering Specifications</label>\n        <textarea id=\"message-105\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Describe requirements, target framework, and test assertions...\" required class=\"w-full p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 text-white text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-md transition\">Dispatch Autonomous Agents</button>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</section>", "metadata": {"category": "forms", "difficulty": "advanced", "quality": 0.785}}
{"id": "html_000012", "instruction": "Build a production-quality, accessible heroes component in dark_indigo style.", "context": {"framework": "html-css-tailwind", "requirements": ["html", "heroes", "production-quality"], "category": "heroes"}, "input": "", "output": "<header class=\"w-full border-b border-zinc-800/80 bg-zinc-950/80 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-50\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\">\n    <a href=\"/\" class=\"font-extrabold text-white text-lg tracking-tight\">Orn\u00e0ment<span class=\"text-indigo-400\">.dev</span></a>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Primary\" class=\"hidden md:flex items-center space-x-6 text-sm text-zinc-400\">\n      <a href=\"#features\" class=\"hover:text-white transition\">Features</a>\n      <a href=\"#pricing\" class=\"hover:text-white transition\">Pricing</a>\n      <a href=\"#about\" class=\"hover:text-white transition\">About</a>\n      <a href=\"/contact\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white text-xs font-semibold shadow-md\">Get Started</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<main class=\"relative overflow-hidden py-24 bg-[#09090b] text-white\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 text-center space-y-6\">\n    <div class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 text-indigo-400\">\n      <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-current animate-pulse\"></span>\n      <span>Autonomous Release v3.0</span>\n    </div>\n    <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight text-white\">Next-Generation Intelligent Design Systems</h1>\n    <p class=\"text-lg text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Engineered with surgical minimal diffs, multi-level Playwright verification, and WCAG accessibility compliance.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-4\">\n      <a href=\"/get-started\" class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-